# Tests for the package's module.

squareTest is test
squareTest purpose "Three squared is nine"
squareTest verifies square sideTimesSide
squareTest typeParam none
squareTest input none
squareTest output none
squareTest outputOwner none
squareTest raises none
squareTest effect none
squareTest uses none
squareTest memory heap false
squareTest async false
squareTest maxRecursion none
squareTest label begin loopKind none
squareTest label begin within none
squareTest let three immutable Int64 3
squareTest let nine immutable Int64 9
squareTest at begin do run
squareTest at begin do expect
squareTest at begin return ok none

run is call
run in squareTest
run invokes square
run arg side Int64 three copy
run out result Int64
run ownedBy none
run cleanedBy none
run borrows none
run catch none

expect is call
expect in squareTest
expect invokes test.assertEqualInt64
expect arg expected Int64 nine copy
expect arg actual Int64 result copy
expect out none
expect ownedBy none
expect cleanedBy none
expect borrows none
expect catch none
